The program of omp-target-send-array.m, compiled by the driver for the
machine's GPU and run there: the callback copies each array from the device
while the kernel runs, by the small copies' path and, at 2 MiB, the large.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-send-array.m -o %t.O2
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY timeout -k 1 60 %t.O2 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-send-array.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
